OL,3,CLiverpool complete #123million signing
OL,4,Cof Bradley Barcola from PSG
OL,6,FLiverpool have completed the signing
OL,7,Fof Bradley Barcola from Paris St
OL,8,FGermain in a #123million deal.
OL,10,FThe Reds will pay an initial
OL,11,F#106million for the France
OL,12,Finternational and up to #17million in
OL,13,Fpotential add-ons.
OL,15,FThe 23-year-old forward has agreed a
OL,16,F"long-term contract" at Anfield.
