OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F302A1788200393
OL,3,CLiverpool complete #123million signing
OL,4,Cof Bradley Barcola from PSG
OL,6,F"It took a long time but I'm really
OL,7,Fhappy today to be able to play for
OL,8,FLiverpool and all I want is to be on
OL,9,Fthe pitch and be able to play," he
OL,10,Ftold the club website.
OL,12,F"I hope to achieve very big things.
OL,13,FFirst of all, winning the Premier
OL,14,FLeague ` it's one of my biggest dreams
OL,15,Fin my life.
OL,17,F"It is to do that and to stay in this
OL,18,Fteam in the long term ` that's why I
OL,19,Fsigned a long contract ` and I hope I
OL,20,Fcan do it."
