OL,3,CLiverpool complete #123million signing
OL,4,Cof Bradley Barcola from PSG
OL,6,FBarcola, a member of the PSG squad
OL,7,Fwhich won back-to-back Champions
OL,8,FLeague titles in the past two seasons,
OL,9,Fwas Liverpool's top target throughout
OL,10,Fthe summer.
OL,12,FThe French champions initially wanted
OL,13,F#145m for the player but there was a
OL,14,Fbreakthrough in negotiations last week.
OL,16,FBarcola joined PSG from Lyon in a
OL,17,F#38.6m deal in 2023.
