OL,3,CLiverpool complete #123million signing
OL,4,Cof Bradley Barcola from PSG
OL,6,FHe registered 39 goals in 152
OL,7,Fappearances and won three successive
OL,8,FLigue 1 titles during his time in
OL,9,FParis.
OL,11,FBarcola made his France debut in June
OL,12,F2024 and has scored six times in 28
OL,13,Fgames for his country. Three of those
OL,14,Fgoals came at this summer's World Cup,
OL,15,Fwhere Les Bleus finished fourth.
